cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this library, please cite it using the metadata below. Most of it is a port of
  OptLib; please cite OptLib as well.
type: software
title: "ConvexAnalysis: convex analysis and subdifferential calculus in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / Mathlib library of convex analysis and subdifferential calculus: convex functions,
  subgradients, conjugates, proximal maps, optimality conditions and first-order algorithms,
  starting from a port of OptLib.
authors:
  - family-names: Villacís
    given-names: David
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-11-25
license: Apache-2.0
identifiers:
